        <h2 class="d2">A place without boundaries.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="margin-top:0">The space is an old warehouse, one of many typically found in Psyrri. A complete renovation was carried out in 2021 by PONI Architects, giving it its current industrial character.</p>
        <p>Guests are welcomed by a striking marble table that seats ten, designed for dinners and tastings. Beyond it, a living room unfolds, surrounded by shelves brimming with bottles and cases. The kitchen is at the back, so chefs can work discreetly on the signature dinners.</p>
